{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"d2b5ffe2c45df7b65be2c7c969551f3589d09bce687c9342b17a03c74e6918a4","digest":{"component_or_area":"event envelope composition and reducer","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py","src/rebar/_commands/txn.py","src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py","src/rebar/_commands/claim.py","src/rebar/_commands/delete.py","src/rebar/_commands/compact.py","src/rebar/reducer/_processors.py","append_event","transition_core","claim_core","_write_unlink","_write_event","_compact_locked","rebuild_snapshot_from_full_log","process_create","process_comment","process_revert","process_signature","attribution_fields","_ATTRIBUTION_CACHE","identity.resolve_current_identity"],"problem_keywords":["event attribution","authorship","denormalized identity","replay back-compat","envelope composition","author_email","author_id"],"propositions":["Denormalized author identity (name, email, optional author_id) must be stamped onto every mutating event envelope without breaking replay of pre-change events.","An attribution helper must compute and cache author_email and optional author_id per repo_root, running git-config and identity resolution at most once per physical repository in a process.","All four LOCAL event-composing sites (append_event, transition_core/claim_core, _write_unlink/_write_event, and SNAPSHOT composition) must stamp attribution fields into the event envelope via an optional attribution parameter.","The reducer must surface author_email and author_id as present-only keys at the same structural location where author already appears (top-level at process_create; per-entry in comment/revert/signature records).","Pre-change events without author_email/author_id must reduce to compiled state byte-identical to pre-change, containing neither key anywhere.","Inbound Jira-reconciler events are deliberately excluded; they attribute to the external Jira author, not the local git user."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785819796253730109,"uuid":"51fdbf27-249d-4d1d-a477-21c97748e723"}